{"ID":"20240513083232-dmsw2om","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083232-dmsw2om","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083232-dmsw2om\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513134251-0pj4ezb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513134256-q7sdfv5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513134251-0pj4ezb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:483,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:483\u0026#125;","title":"141","type":"doc","updated":"20240515123029"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513134251-0pj4ezb","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 802px;","id":"20240513134251-0pj4ezb","updated":"20240515123029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"117-04 S, T"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"58歲,體型稍胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20080501"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺積水,雙足水腫"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 服前方無口脣麻"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 可平躺睡"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 胃口仍不好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 小便增加一些"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 口渴無"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. 手足冷退許多"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. 雙腿仍水腫(因炙甘草能蓄水)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈數仍有,比上次好,約一息6-7至,上次一息8-9至且時快時慢"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白濕厚,皺"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→寒水包住"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"師曰: 像把熱的引擎丟到冰水裡，危險!"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 病人進步中."},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"*"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"em text","TextMarkTextContent":"金反侮火,不生水,故水腫. 火被金刑,故不生土"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方： 同前穴(陰陵泉 地機 三陰交 復溜 水泉 照海 公孫 內關 足三里 巨闕 關元)"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生附子三錢(另包) 乾姜二錢 桂枝五錢 大棗十枚"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白朮五錢  茯苓五錢  澤瀉六錢  豬苓三錢  陳皮三錢  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"洋參三錢半夏四錢  知母五錢  吳茱萸三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"貳付  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗水煮三碗  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"bf B/S"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.此方為四逆湯,五苓散,胃苓湯,腎著湯合方"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.乾姜健肺,吳茱萸溫胃止嘔,知母去心包積濕"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.上一次方中重用炙甘草因病人情況嚴重(腳腫差一吋至膝,心跳約140下每分鐘)"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→急需先護住心脈故"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.今日來診脈較緩,故去炙甘草,即可排出水"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人原有二碗尚未喝,先停用,改喝今天之藥"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240513134256-q7sdfv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240513134256-q7sdfv5"}}]}